                                "sense_id": "33e8b3eb-8d23-36e9-a398-26aa3309f0f0",
                                "text": "The Street-Artists—as black profile-cutters, blind paper-cutters, “screevers” or draughtsmen in coloured chalks on the pavement, writers without hands, and readers without eyes."
